<title>SPAIN: Spain's CNMV suspends Gines Navarro, and OCP.</title>
<headline>Spain's CNMV suspends Gines Navarro, and OCP.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's stock market watchdog CNMV said on Monday it had suspended trading in Gines Navarro and OCP Construcciones shares.</p>
<p>The CNMV said only that the decision was due to special factors which could affect the two companies.  </p>
<p>Industry sources added that the two companies were to announce a possible merger later on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
